1. H3 - Hexagonal hierarchical geospatial indexing system
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Copyright Uber Technologies, Inc.
   https://github.com/uber/h3

   The H3 implementation in `index::h3` is ported from the H3 C reference
   implementation. The constant tables - base cells, faces, and the FaceIJK
   base-cell lookup - are the standard H3 data, lifted verbatim.

   The `h3o` Rust crate (https://github.com/HydroniumLabs/h3o) was used as a
   differential-test oracle while the port was developed. It is not a dependency
